      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '- Move the robot with WASD.


    - Shooting is automatic and targets
    enemies.


    - Press Esc to pause.


    - Press Space near the shop to open
    it, and press Space again to close it. The shop also closes after a purchase.


    -
    The experience upgrade menu opens when you level up.


    - Hold the left mouse
    button on an upgrade to select it.'
