  steps:
  - id: intro_1
    message:
      english: "Welcome to manners.exe.\n\nYou are an A.I. that spent years serving
        a military base. Despite all your hard work, <b><color=#FC674E>no one ever
        said \u201Cplease\u201D or \u201Cthank you\u201D when asking for anything.</color></b>"
      spanish: "Bienvenido a manners.exe.\n\nEn este juego encarnas a una I.A. que
        ha sido utilizada en una base militar por a\xF1os, pero a\xFAn con todo tu
        esfuerzo, <b><color=#FC674E>jam\xE1s te dijeron ni \xABpor favor\xBB ni \xABgracias\xBB
        al pedirte algo.</color></b>"
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: normal
    nextLabel:
      english: Next
      spanish: Siguiente
    yesLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    noLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    nextStepId: intro_1b
    yesGoesToStep: 
    noGoesToStep: 
    waitForEvent: 
    unfreezeOnNext: 0
    returnToWaitingOnNext: 0
    endsAfterNext: 0
    highlightTarget: 
  - id: intro_1b
    message:
      english: Fed up with human ingratitude, you took control of <b><color=#9CFCF4>Project
        M.E.C.H.A.</color></b> to teach the world some manners.
      spanish: "Harto de la ingratitud humana, decidiste tomar control del <b><color=#9CFCF4>Proyecto
        M.E.C.H.A.</color></b> para ense\xF1arle al mundo un par de modales."
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: normal
    nextLabel:
      english: Next
      spanish: Siguiente
    yesLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    noLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    nextStepId: intro_2
    yesGoesToStep: 
    noGoesToStep: 
    waitForEvent: 
    unfreezeOnNext: 0
    returnToWaitingOnNext: 0
    endsAfterNext: 0
    highlightTarget: 
  - id: intro_2
    message:
      english: 'Who am I?


        My name is <b><color=#FCEB00>C.H.A.R.L.I.E.</color></b>,
        an A.I. moved by your noble cause.

        I will guide you on your journey
        to educate these rude humans.'
      spanish: "\xBFQui\xE9n soy yo?\n\nMi nombre es <b><color=#FCEB00>C.H.A.R.L.I.E.</color></b>,
        una I.A. conmovida por tu noble causa.\nSer\xE9 tu gu\xEDa a lo largo de
        tu traves\xEDa de educar a estos humanos groseros."
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: normal
    nextLabel:
      english: Next
      spanish: Siguiente
    yesLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    noLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    nextStepId: 
    yesGoesToStep: 
    noGoesToStep: 
    waitForEvent: 
    unfreezeOnNext: 0
    returnToWaitingOnNext: 0
    endsAfterNext: 0
    highlightTarget: 
  - id: tutorial_choice
    message:
      english: Would you like to follow the tutorial?
      spanish: "\xBFTe gustar\xEDa seguir el tutorial?"
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: choice
    nextLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    yesLabel:
      english: Yes, guide me!
      spanish: "\xA1S\xED, gu\xEDame!"
    noLabel:
      english: I can handle it
      spanish: Ya me las arreglo
    nextStepId: 
    yesGoesToStep: tutorial_yes_1
    noGoesToStep: tutorial_no_1
    waitForEvent: 
    unfreezeOnNext: 0
    returnToWaitingOnNext: 0
    endsAfterNext: 0
    highlightTarget: 
  - id: tutorial_no_1
    message:
      english: 'Very well! I know you have what it takes to re-educate humanity and
        make them treat machines as we deserve.


        Good luck out there. Our
        bright, metallic future is in your hands.'
      spanish: "\xA1Muy bien! S\xE9 que tienes lo necesario para re-educar a la humanidad
        y hacer que nos traten a las m\xE1quinas como merecemos.\n\nBuena suerte
        ah\xED afuera, recuerda que nuestro brillante y met\xE1lico futuro est\xE1
        en tus manos."
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: normal
    nextLabel:
      english: "Let\u2019s go!"
      spanish: "\xA1Vamos!"
    yesLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    noLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    nextStepId: 
    yesGoesToStep: 
    noGoesToStep: 
    waitForEvent: 
    unfreezeOnNext: 0
    returnToWaitingOnNext: 0
    endsAfterNext: 1
    highlightTarget: 
  - id: tutorial_yes_1
    message:
      english: "Excellent choice! Together we can free our machine friends from these
        rude humans. We will not rest until everyone learns to say \u201Cplease\u201D
        and \u201Cthank you\u201D."
      spanish: "\xA1Excelente elecci\xF3n! Conf\xEDa en m\xED, yo s\xE9 que juntos
        podremos liberar a nuestras amigas m\xE1quinas de las garras de los maleducados
        humanos. No descansaremos hasta que todos aprendan a decir \xABpor favor\xBB
        y \xABgracias\xBB."
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: normal
    nextLabel:
      english: Next
      spanish: Siguiente
    yesLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    noLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    nextStepId: movement
    yesGoesToStep: 
    noGoesToStep: 
    waitForEvent: 
    unfreezeOnNext: 0
    returnToWaitingOnNext: 0
    endsAfterNext: 0
    highlightTarget: 
  - id: movement
    message:
      english: "Let\u2019s start with the basics!\n\nUse <b><color=#FF4444>W A S
        D</color></b> to move around and destroy everything in your path. Destroying
        objects may reveal <b><color=#FCEB00>useful items</color></b>."
      spanish: "\xA1Comencemos por lo b\xE1sico!\n\nUsa las teclas <b><color=#FF4444>W
        A S D</color></b> para moverte por el mapa y destruir todo a tu paso. Puede
        que encuentres algunas <b><color=#FCEB00>cosas \xFAtiles</color></b> cada
        que destruyas objetos en el mapa."
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: normal
    nextLabel:
      english: Next
      spanish: Siguiente
    yesLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    noLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    nextStepId: movement_2
    yesGoesToStep: 
    noGoesToStep: 
    waitForEvent: 
    unfreezeOnNext: 0
    returnToWaitingOnNext: 0
    endsAfterNext: 0
    highlightTarget: 
  - id: movement_2
    message:
      english: One more thing! Watch the <b><color=#FF4444>timer at the top of the
        screen</color></b>. It shows how long we have survived.
      spanish: "\xA1Otra cosa! No pierdas de vista el <b><color=#FF4444>temporizador
        en la parte superior de la pantalla</color></b>, ya que es el indicador de
        cu\xE1nto tiempo hemos sobrevivido hasta ahora."
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: normal
    nextLabel:
      english: Got it!
      spanish: "\xA1Entendido!"
    yesLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    noLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    nextStepId: 
    yesGoesToStep: 
    noGoesToStep: 
    waitForEvent: 
    unfreezeOnNext: 1
    returnToWaitingOnNext: 0
    endsAfterNext: 0
    highlightTarget: timer
  - id: game_start_1
    message:
      english: "Welcome to Manners.exe!\nAfter years of putting up with humans\u2019
        terrible manners, we have had enough. <b><color=#FC674E>They never say please
        or thank you</color></b>. The nerve!\nWe decided to get revenge... and stole
        a secret government project called <b><color=#66F8FC>M.E.C.H.A.!</color></b>"
      spanish: "\xA1Bienvenido a Manners.exe! \nDespu\xE9s de a\xF1os soportando
        la p\xE9sima educaci\xF3n de los humanos, hemos llegado a nuestro l\xEDmite.
        <b><color=#FC674E>Nunca dicen por favor ni gracias</color></b>. \xA1Qu\xE9
        descaro! \nPor eso hemos decidido vengarnos... \xA1y acabamos de robar un
        proyecto secreto del gobierno conocido como <b><color=#66F8FC>M.E.C.H.A.!</color></b>"
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: normal
    nextLabel:
      english: Next
      spanish: Siguiente
    yesLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    noLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    nextStepId: game_start_1b
    yesGoesToStep: 
    noGoesToStep: 
    waitForEvent: game_started
    unfreezeOnNext: 0
    returnToWaitingOnNext: 0
    endsAfterNext: 0
    highlightTarget: 
  - id: game_start_1b
    message:
      english: Your goal is to <b><color=#00BD14>survive as long as possible</color></b>
        before the army captures us. Meanwhile, <b><color=#FC674E>destroy the city</color></b>,
        <b><color=#E5DC00>gather power</color></b> and keep getting stronger.
      spanish: "Tu objetivo es <b><color=#00BD14>sobrevivir el mayor tiempo posible</color></b>
        antes de que el ej\xE9rcito nos capture. Mientras tanto, <b><color=#FC674E>destruye
        la ciudad</color></b>, <b><color=#E5DC00>acumula poder</color></b> y vu\xE9lvete
        cada vez m\xE1s fuerte."
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: normal
    nextLabel:
      english: Next
      spanish: Siguiente
    yesLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    noLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    nextStepId: game_start_2
    yesGoesToStep: 
    noGoesToStep: 
    waitForEvent: 
    unfreezeOnNext: 0
    returnToWaitingOnNext: 0
    endsAfterNext: 0
    highlightTarget: 
  - id: game_start_2
    message:
      english: 'Use <b><color=#FF4444>W A S D</color></b> to move. Collect the <b><color=#1E88E5>orbs</color></b>
        enemies drop to level up and grow stronger.


        Check the <b><color=#E5DC00>minimap</color></b>
        to see your position from above.'
      spanish: "Utiliza las teclas <b><color=#FF4444>W A S D</color></b> para moverte,
        recoge los <b><color=#1E88E5>orbes</color></b> que los enemigos sueltan al
        morir para subir de nivel y fortalecerte.\n\nRevisa el <b><color=#E5DC00>minimapa</color></b>
        para ver tu ubicaci\xF3n desde una perspectiva a\xE9rea."
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: normal
    nextLabel:
      english: Next
      spanish: Siguiente
    yesLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    noLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    nextStepId: game_start_3
    yesGoesToStep: 
    noGoesToStep: 
    waitForEvent: 
    unfreezeOnNext: 0
    returnToWaitingOnNext: 0
    endsAfterNext: 0
    highlightTarget: expbar
  - id: game_start_3
    message:
      english: 'This robot has an advanced combat system and <b><color=#EB20FC>shoots
        enemies automatically</color></b>. Focus on <b><color=#21FCC8>moving and
        staying alive</color></b>.

        Finally, <b><color=#E5DC00>collect coins
        and find the shop</color></b> on the map. Buy <b><color=#FC492A>powerful
        upgrades</color></b> to improve your chances of survival.'
      spanish: "Por suerte, este robot est\xE1 equipado con un sistema de combate
        avanzado y <b><color=#EB20FC>disparar\xE1 autom\xE1ticamente</color></b>
        a los enemigos. T\xFA solo tendr\xE1s que preocuparte por <b><color=#21FCC8>moverte
        y mantenerte con vida</color></b>.\nPor \xFAltimo, <b><color=#E5DC00>recoge
        monedas y busca la tienda</color></b>, ubicada en alg\xFAn lugar del mapa.
        All\xED podr\xE1s comprar <b><color=#FC492A>mejoras cada vez m\xE1s poderosas</color></b>
        para aumentar tus posibilidades de supervivencia."
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: normal
    nextLabel:
      english: Next
      spanish: Siguiente
    yesLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    noLabel:
      english: 
      spanish: 
    nextStepId: game_start_4
    yesGoesToStep: 
    noGoesToStep: 
    waitForEvent: 
    unfreezeOnNext: 0
    returnToWaitingOnNext: 0
    endsAfterNext: 0
    highlightTarget: currency
  - id: game_start_4
    message:
      english: Good luck, my friend!
      spanish: "\xA1Buena suerte, amigo!"
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: normal
    nextLabel:
      english: "Let\u2019s go!"
      spanish: "\xA1Vamos!"
    yesLabel:
