  - id: coins_1
    message:
      english: You have started destroying your first buildings! I am so proud. You
        have grown so much.
      spanish: "\xA1Veo que ya comenzaste a destruir tus primeros edificios! \u2014
        Estoy tan orgulloso, has crecido tanto."
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
