  - id: first_shot_1
    message:
      english: 'The soldiers have finally arrived. Of course they would not give
        up without a fight! But do not worry: we can handle a few little tanks and
        fully armed jeeps.'
      spanish: "Parece ser que los soldados al fin est\xE1n aqu\xED \u2014 era obvio
        que no se rendir\xEDan sin dar pelea, pero no te preocupes, claramente podemos
        con unos peque\xF1os tanques de guerra y jeeps completamente armados."
    showArrow: 0
    arrowAngle: 0
    freezeGame: 1
    stepType: normal
    nextLabel:
