    highlightTarget: expbar
  - id: first_orb_2b
    message:
      english: 'The higher your level, the stronger you become!


        But be
        careful: rushing for orbs without a plan can let soldiers surround you.'
      spanish: "\xA1Cuanto m\xE1s nivel, m\xE1s fuerte te vuelves!\n\n\xA1Pero no
        te precipites! \u2014 ir corriendo por los orbes sin pensar podr\xEDa hacer
        que los soldados te rodeen f\xE1cilmente."
