  - id: first_damage_1
    message:
      english: Ouch! That hurt. But it is nothing compared with the glory of defeating
        these rude humans.
      spanish: "\xA1Auch! Eso doli\xF3 \u2014 pero no te preocupes, no es nada comparado
        con la gloria de derrotar a estos humanos maleducados."
