  - id: first_levelup_1
    message:
      english: Excellent work! Those humans are about to discover what we are made
        of.
      spanish: "\xA1Magn\xEDfico trabajo \u2014 esos humanos est\xE1n a punto de
        descubrir de qu\xE9 estamos hechos!"
