  - id: first_levelup_2
    message:
      english: 'Each level lets you choose <b><color=#FF4444>one of three random
        upgrades</color></b>. Choose wisely: your decisions shape the whole match.'
      spanish: "Cada vez que subas de nivel, deber\xE1s elegir <b><color=#FF4444>una
        de 3 mejoras aleatorias</color></b>. Elige sabiamente \u2014 tu elecci\xF3n
        definir\xE1 el rumbo de toda tu partida."
